DESCRIPTION >
    Historical ActiveCampaign tag semantics used to distinguish real identity changes
    from Fivetran sync-timestamp churn. One row is retained per tag and source version.

SCHEMA >
    `tag_id` String `json:$.tag_id`,
    `tag_name` Nullable(String) `json:$.tag_name`,
    `source_version` DateTime64(6) `json:$.source_version`,
    `is_deleted` UInt8 `json:$.is_deleted`,
    `semantic_hash` FixedString(64) `json:$.semantic_hash`

ENGINE ReplacingMergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "tag_id, source_version"
